> Steps:
> 1. If empty, return empty structure.
> 2. projectStart = min start_date.
> 3. offset(task) = projectStart->diffInDays(start_date)
> 4. duration(task) = max(1, duration_days)
> 5. Build predecessor map: task->predecessor_id.
> 6. Topological order: Kahn's algorithm on graph where edge pred -> task.
>    - Detect cycles: if topo order incomplete, fall back to start_date ordering.
> 7. Forward pass:
>    - es[t] = offset(t)
>    - for pred p of t with dependency_type:
>        if FS: es[t] = max(es[t], ef[p] + lag)
>        if SS: es[t] = max(es[t], es[p] + lag)
>    - ef[t] = es[t] + duration[t]
> 8. projectEnd = max(ef)
> 9. Backward pass (reverse topo order):
>    - lf[t] = projectEnd if no successors
>    - else: lf[t] = min over successors s:
>        if s.dependency_type == FS: ls[s] - lag(s)
